# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AARIS — what stays out of git
#
# Rule of thumb: the repository holds source, the frozen edge model, small
# JSON/log evidence and the screenshots. Everything that is either public
# (the NASA dataset), regenerable (training runs, plots, checkpoints) or
# local state (SQLite DB, venv, logs) is ignored.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- local environment -----------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
.env                        # real secrets; .env.example is the tracked template
*.local

# --- Python ---------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
notebook6c46117e1e.ipynb

# --- runtime state ---------------------------------------------------------
# SQLite ground station DB + every backup the demo tooling has made.
# Regenerate with: powershell -File demo\run_demo.ps1 -Reset
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.bak
*.bak_*

# --- public source data (44 MB, not ours to redistribute) ------------------
# NASA C-MAPSS FD001: https://data.nasa.gov/Aerospace/CMAPSS-Jet-Engine-Simulated-Data/ff5v-kuh6
# Unzip into Dataset/ — the file layout is described in Dataset/readme.txt.
Dataset/

# --- regenerable training artefacts ---------------------------------------
# Transformer checkpoints (~6.6 MB each) and the backup copy of the plot set.
*.pt
outputs_backup/
# Full experiment runs (428 MB of per-seed CSVs, curves and intermediate
# windows). Re-run with experiments/*.py; the small JSON summaries in
# results/ are tracked and are what docs/ cites.
results/engine_split/
results/frozen_baseline_2026-10-11/
results/targeted/
results/seed_43/
results/seed_44/
results/run_seed42_main/

# --- OS / editor -----------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
